            "lit": "[Main] If your opponent has 5 or more cards in their hand, they trash 1 card in their hand. Then, delete 1 of your opponent\u0027s level 7 or lower Digimon. For every 3 cards in your opponent\u0027s hand, remove 1 from this effect\u0027s level maximum."
